    "notes": {
        "0cc36317-0a44-42c9-8d29-7e20b2bb8f12": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 1232,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 256,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data\n\n- Creates a hidden event type **e2e-calcom-bookings-<timestamp>** (requires confirmation) and deletes it at the end; the timestamp keeps the slug free even if an earlier run stopped before the cleanup.\n- The connected user needs **free time in the next 8 days** in the default availability schedule (the default working hours are enough), otherwise Find Available Slots returns nothing.\n- Bookings go to **test+calcom-e2e@appmixer.ai**; Cal.com sends confirmation emails there. The added guest uses a different base address (Cal.com treats plus-addresses of an attendee as the same email and rejects them)."
        }
    }
